Material published by others
----------------------------

Alongside the source code this repository carries material published by other
people. It is here because without it nothing in MODEL_CARD.md can be checked
by anyone:

  eval/*.csv        Headlines and leads of Polish news articles, each with the
                    URL it came from, annotated as the reference sets every
                    measurement was taken against. Article bodies were never
                    collected and are not here.

  tests/fixtures/   Two responses saved on 18 August 2026 - an Interia RSS feed
                    and a TV Republika listing page. They exist so that a parser
                    broken by a redesign fails in CI rather than quietly a week
                    later.

This material is included for analysis and research, remains the property of the
publishers named beside it, and is not offered for reuse as content. The
Apache-2.0 grant above covers the source code and does not extend to it.

Publishers who reserve text and data mining rights are excluded from it. See
COMPLIANCE.md, which explains what that reservation is and where the project
records it.
